flowchart LR
  N1["Select reviewed evidence<br/>Permitted lawyer-reviewed findings<br/>Exact source and finding revisions<br/>Coverage and open items retained"]
  N2["Create a report version<br/>Draft prose and annex snapshots<br/>Word draft for internal review<br/>Keep report and content hashes"]
  N3["Check quality and citations<br/>Verify the retained evidence<br/>Fix through an explicit new version<br/>Changed drafts need new review"]
  N4["Independent internal decision<br/>Clearance and independence checked<br/>Approve or reject the exact version<br/>Record rationale and history"]
  N5["Separate audience release<br/>Halden and Castlegate differ<br/>Apply antitrust gate when required<br/>No unreviewed external publication"]
  N6["Download permitted package<br/>Recheck source and audience scope<br/>Keep prior approved versions<br/>Revocation cannot recall copies"]
  N1 --> N2
  N2 --> N3
  N3 --> N4
  N4 --> N5
  N5 --> N6
